<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Sui N Gas pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Sui N Gas pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial year ended June 30, 1996 (in million rupees).</p>
<p>    Sales		 14,180 vs 10,541</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 765 vs    671</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit	414 vs    482</p>
<p>    Dividend		 nil vs    nil</p>
<p>    Bonus stocks	15 pct vs 20 pct (per 10-rupee share)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Sui Northern Gas Pipelines Ltd.</p>
<p>Most shares in the state-run firm are held by the government.</p>
<p>Ex-bonus date February 16.</p>
<p>((-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192)</p>
</text>
